      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clipboard pastes the item you choose into the app you were using.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clipboard colle l'élément choisi dans l'app que vous utilisiez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding ⌘V and pasting into the app you were using need Accessibility access for Clipboard. Until then, the item you choose is copied: press ⌘V to paste it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenir ⌘V et coller dans l'app que vous utilisiez nécessitent l'accès Accessibilité pour Clipboard. En attendant, l'élément choisi est copié : appuyez sur ⌘V pour le coller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Accessibility Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les réglages d'accessibilité"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add App": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter une app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps to ignore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps à ignorer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is copied in these apps is not kept. Passwords that password managers mark as private are never kept, whatever the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui est copié dans ces apps n'est pas conservé. Les mots de passe que les gestionnaires marquent comme privés ne sont jamais conservés, quelle que soit l'app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current profile": {
      "localizations": {
